'''Diamondhead''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapien]]<ref>[[Camille's Ex-Boyfriend]]</ref><ref name="BFAW">''[[Big Fat Alien Wedding]]''</ref> from the planet [[Petropia (Classic)|Petropia]].<ref>[[Tetrax Shard (Classic)|Tetrax Shard]]</ref><ref name="TSoC">''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]''</ref>

==Appearance==
===Ben as Diamondhead===
Being a silicon-based life form,<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="TSoC" />  Diamondhead's body is composed entirely of aquamarine crystals, which are of a very tough and durable diamond-like substance.{{Refn|[[:File:Petrosapiens Made of Diamond-Like Material.png]]|group = MW}} He sports four crystal shards on his back and has a sharp head.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Diamondhead had yellow eyes and wore a sleeveless uniform that was black on the right half and white on the left with a black patch on the left shoulder where the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol was.

In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Diamondhead wore a yellow raincoat.

In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Diamondhead looked the same as in the '''Original Series''', except his eyes had jewel-like facets and his outfit had detailed textures.

In '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time|Race Against Time]]''''', Diamondhead's skin was semi-translucent. His skin was a darker shade of green while his bodysuit is more metallic with some patterns of spandex.

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Diamondhead's lower body, torso, and the top of his head were similar to [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]]'s, consisting of an indigo rock which has black lines and dots over it. There were six crystal shards on his back instead of four and he also sported two more on the front of his chest. His eyes were green and he wore the original Omnitrix/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest. Gwen Prime as Diamondhead shared these exact same traits.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Diamondhead had crystal blades on his forearms and his crystal skin looked more realistic due to being drawn in '''Generator Rex'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s art style. He also had a vertical black line in the middle of his face.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Diamondhead has sleeveless clothing that is all black with one large green stripe down the middle up to his belt, and wears black pants. He has a green belt with white stripes on which he wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol. Diamondhead no longer bears the crystals on his chest, and the crystals on his back have also grown in length. His jaw is larger, he wears black shoes that are green on the bottom, and there are now only two crystal shards on his back. His arms and shoulders also seem to have much more girth.

11-year-old Diamondhead looks almost the same as in the '''Original Series''', but the left side of his suit is missing the black patch around the Omnitrix symbol and the crystals on his back, as well as his jaw, are bigger. His eyes are green and the Omnitrix is recolored.

===Kevin as Diamondhead===
[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]'s Diamondhead looked the exact same as [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s did in the '''Original Series''', but without a black patch on the left side of his uniform. He also lacks an Omnitrix symbol.

===Gwen as Diamondhead===
[[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] as Diamondhead has darker and shinier crystals, thinner arms, a more rounded body, no shards on her back, and a more square head. She wears a uniform like Ben's Diamondhead in the '''Original Series''', except it is half dark blue, half light blue. She wears the original Omnitrix symbol on the left side of her chest.

===Ben 10,000 as Diamondhead===
[[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s Diamondhead's diamond shards on his back were bigger. He wore a black sleeveless shirt, white pants and black boots, and the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] symbol on the center of his chest.

===Albedo as Negative Diamondhead===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Diamondhead looked exactly like Ben's Diamondhead in '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''', except his eyes and Ultimatrix symbol were recolored red.

===Gwen 10 as Diamondhead===
[[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]]'s Diamondhead almost looks the same as her [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|non-canon counterpart]] but is somewhat slimmer and is more bluish colored. Her eyes and original [[Omnitrix (Gweniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol are pink and she has a hairclip just like Gwen 10. Her outfit on the left side is different, as she now has a black patch on her left chest and a blue cat logo around her Omnitrix symbol. Similar to Gwen 10's pants, her own come halfway up her calf, and she wears black shoes.

===Mad Ben as Mad Diamondhead===

[[Mad Ben]]'s Diamondhead has an almost completely black Mad Ben-style outfit with an orange belt, a small orange cross on his chest, and orange bandages on his forearms, thighs, and shins. His body is composed of pale blue crystals and like Mad Ben's [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]], he has silver spike pads with orange spikes on his knee joints, thighs, forearms, shoulders, and feet. He lacks the rear head spike that [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]'s Diamondhead has, but has a Mohawk consisting of three spikes instead. His [[Power Watch|Omnitrix]] is on his chest and colored orange, like his eyes.

