==Trivia==
*After the destruction of [[Petropia (Classic)|Petropia]] and prior to the resurrection of the planet and its people in ''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]'', Diamondhead and [[Tetrax Shard (Classic)|Tetrax]] were the only known [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapiens]] alive.
*[[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] was indirectly responsible for naming Diamondhead.<ref name="ATTW10"/>
*Diamondhead is the first alien to be used more than once in the same episode.
*Diamondhead is the only alien other than [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] to defeat [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].
** Diamondhead is also the only alien other than [[Feedback]] to defeat [[Malware]].
*Diamondhead was the first on-screen transformation used with the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|original Ultimatrix]].<ref>''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]''</ref>
*Diamondhead makes a crystalline metallic sound every time he moves.
*Diamondhead is one of only five aliens to appear in each of the Classic Continuity series; the other four are [[Upchuck]], [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]], [[Ghostfreak]], and Way Big. 
**Currently, Cannonbolt, Diamondhead, and Way Big are the only three of these aliens to have appeared in all series of the franchise.
*Diamondhead is one of [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s favorite aliens.<ref name="K10" />
*Diamondhead is not made of [[Taydenite]] and his crystals have no value.{{Refn|[[:File:Diamondhead Is Not Made of Taydenite.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Taydenite Practically Indestructible.png]]|group = DM}}
*In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Diamondhead protected his vital organs with an impervious solid purple crystal on his chest.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}}
*[[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]]'s reformation into Diamondhead in ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'' had nothing to do with [[Vilgax's Champion Sword|Vilgax's sword]] being covered in crystal before he killed him.{{Refn|[[:File:AF Diamondhead Nothing to Do With Vilgax's Sword.PNG]]|group = DM}}
**[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] does not know the explanation behind Chromastone merging with Diamondhead, but [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] does.{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth Knows the Reason For AF Diamondhead.png]]|group = DM|name = Diamondstone}}
*Diamondhead was initially supposed to be an additional alien, while Cannonbolt would take his place as one of the original 10 aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:I10 Quick Facts CANNONBOLT.png]]|group = pop-up}}{{Refn|''[[I-10: The Ben 10 User Generated Experience]]''|group = CN}}
*Diamondhead was initially not supposed to appear in:
**''[[Singlehanded]]'', with Chromastone taking his place.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/3f/Singlehanded_Script_Outline.pdf ''Singlehanded'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**''[[If All Else Fails]]'', with Chromastone taking his place.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/c/c5/IAEF_Script_Outline.pdf ''If All Else Fails'' Script Outline]|group = outline|name = outline}}
**The dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*In ''[[Basic Training]]'', Diamondhead was originally supposed to be used to fight [[Trombipulor]] in the cold open, in addition to being used in the combat exercise against [[Alpha Squad]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/31/Basic_Training_Draft-1.pdf ''Basic Training'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}
*Diamondhead was supposed to be used twice in ''[[Revenge of the Swarm]]'' serving [[Terraspin]] and [[Waterhazard]]'s roles.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/84/Revenge_of_the_Swarm_DRAFT-1.pdf ''Revenge of the Swarm'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}
*Derrick guessed that Diamondhead's ability to levitate crystal prisms and make explosive projectiles, as seen in ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'', probably originated due to some storyboard artist who was not familiar with Diamondhead's powers.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW's Opinion On Diamondhead's New Powers in AF.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Had [[Albedo|Negative]] Diamondhead appeared in '''Omniverse''', he would have resembled 16-year-old Diamondhead's appearance in said series, except his hues would have been altered{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Was Unaware of Negative Alien Credits.png]]|group = DJW}} and his clothes would have been recolored red.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Negative Diamondhead Outfit.png]]|group = DJW}}
**[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] eventually drew a version of Negative Diamondhead in the '''Omniverse''' art style in 2020.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Negative Diamondhead Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Diamondhead is [[Eric Bauza]] and [[Joe Kelly]]'s favorite alien.{{Refn|https://vimeo.com/96635687|group = EB}}{{Refn|group = JK|https://twitter.com/yasinemiralkaya/status/1771639134660055254}} He is also [[Tim Divar]]'s favorite alien to draw.{{Refn|https://archive.is/BZeKV|group = TD}}

